WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.302
-Now, we all love our pets,

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.804
and every pet owner thinks
that their pet is the best.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.673
Well, I wanted to see
if that was true,

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.141
so it's time for "Why Is
Your Pet Better Than Me?"

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:11.377
Here we go.
-♪ Why is your pet ♪

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.613
♪ Better than me,
better than me? ♪

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.882
♪♪

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:17.850
-Alright,
let's meet our first pet.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.086
Hello, hi. What is your name
and where are you from?

00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:24.490
-Hey, I'm Miranda from Durham,
North Carolina.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.626
-Yeah, Durham. I love it. Hey.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:29.829
Miranda, thank you
for being on the show.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.431
I see -- Oh. Ooh.
I see a cat behind you.

00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:34.767
I'm assuming that's the pet.
What is your cat's --

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.636
Ooh. That's a pretty good trick
right there.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:38.904
Just flops down
and smacks the tail.

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:40.940
Is that...?
-Exactly.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.243
This is Bruce.
-Bruce!

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:46.713
Bruce, hey, buddy.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.714
And what does Bruce do?

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:50.950
Why is your pet better than me?

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.654
-So, Bruce can sometimes
turn the light off.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.523
-I love the "sometimes."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:59.259
What do you mean Bruce
can sometimes turn --

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.326
Oh, you're gone.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:03.630
Alright. So, Bruce.
Alright, Bruce.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.465
Can you do it? Can you
turn the light off, Bruce?

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.468
Bruce? Uh-oh.

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:11.938
Bruce? Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:15.108
This is leaning towards the --
Oh, he's thinking about it.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:16.276
He's thinking about it.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.980
He's thinking about it.
Come on, Bruce. You got this.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.083
Come on, Bruce. Yep.
Come on, Buddy.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:27.386
Come on, Bruce. You got -- Yes.
What is that?

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:29.856
No -- Oh. Yes, Bruce. Come on.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:33.125
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:35.328
D-Do you want to
maybe prop Bruce up maybe

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:38.164
or get Bruce to --
I think -- Here you go.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.266
Bruce.
Show me what you got, Bruce!

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:43.368
Come on, buddy! I see it.
I see it. Look at that.

00:01:43.368 --> 00:01:45.337
I see it, Bruce! Come on!

00:01:45.337 --> 00:01:46.839
Come on, buddy!

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:49.475
Maybe get -- [ Laughs ]

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:51.477
Come on, Bruce!

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:55.381
He -- Can we -- Can we move the
light switch down lower maybe?

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.983
I just -- [ Laughs ]

00:01:57.983 --> 00:02:00.386
Oh, my God. Alright.
There you go.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.922
[ Laughs ]
Alright. Thank you very much.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.790
I appreciate it.
That's fantastic.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:05.958
Thank you, Bruce.

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:07.827
[ Laughs ]

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:09.862
There you go -- Bruce,
the cat that can

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.663
sometimes
turn the light switch off.

00:02:11.663 --> 00:02:13.399
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.534
Now let's get to our next pet.

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:18.404
Uh, hello. Welcome. What is your
name and where are you from?

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.706
Look at this.
-My name is Mike.

00:02:20.706 --> 00:02:22.408
I'm from Keyport, New Jersey.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.809
-Oh, I love -- Now --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:26.279
New Jersey in the house.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.514
Thank you, buddy.
Now, what do you have there?

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:30.383
What are you holding?
What is your -- What is that?

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:34.253
-This is my hedgehog, Tuck.
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:36.055
I didn't even know you could
have a hedgehog as a pet.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.056
That's amazing.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:40.960
And what does your shirt say?

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.495
-"The Hogfather."

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:45.664
-There you go. Of course. Yes.
The hedgehog. It's a hedgehog.

00:02:45.664 --> 00:02:47.966
Now, already
I think he's better than me,

00:02:47.966 --> 00:02:50.736
but what do you have set up,
and please show me

00:02:50.736 --> 00:02:54.274
why is your pet better than me.

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:58.077
-So, Tuck is
an American Hedgehog Warrior,

00:02:58.077 --> 00:03:00.246
and he's going to hopefully

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:02.849
navigate this little
obstacle course I have behind me

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:06.085
and ultimately end up in
our mini ball pit over here.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.688
And I'm not so sure you'd
be able to do that, Jimmy.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:12.558
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:15.428
-You'd be right. You'd be right.
I don't know if I could.

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:17.529
But let's see what Tuck does.

00:03:17.529 --> 00:03:19.665
Our first pet,
the pressure really got to him.

00:03:19.665 --> 00:03:22.535
So let's see.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:24.336
-American Hedgehog --
-Alright, and if you don't mind,

00:03:24.336 --> 00:03:26.005
I think I'm gonna do
a little hog casting

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.473
if that's okay with you.
-Oh, my God.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:29.274
Look at this.
This is an amazing production.

00:03:29.274 --> 00:03:30.943
Alright, buddy.

00:03:30.943 --> 00:03:32.478
-Yeah, he's making his way.
-Yep.

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:36.348
-Making his way way through
Pool Noodle Bars we have here.

00:03:36.348 --> 00:03:39.385
-Has he been hanging out
with Bruce the cat at all?

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:43.022
Feels like they've been out
drinking all night.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:44.156
-I know. I know.

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:46.492
He's usually
a little quicker than this.

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:49.662
-Yeah. Well, pressure's on.
I could do this.

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:50.730
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:53.032
But he looks like
he's making a move maybe.

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:55.268
I think.
-He might be.

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:56.702
He might also
be going to the bathroom.

00:03:56.702 --> 00:03:59.238
They tend to do that a lot.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:01.274
[ Laughs ]

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:03.409
Give me one second.
Let me restart.

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:07.146
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:10.049
-Alright.
Tuck, here we go, buddy.

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:13.619
Here we go.

00:04:13.619 --> 00:04:16.522
-Let me show you the course real
quick while we're waiting here.

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:18.324
-Yeah, might as well
at this point.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:21.227
Tuck definitely hasn't seen it,
so yeah.

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.361
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.361 --> 00:04:25.798
-Oh, oh, oh. Wait. Wait.
A little action.

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:27.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:30.003
-Oh, yeah. This is it.
This is good.

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:31.270
Tuck --
-Wait a sec.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.471
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.471 --> 00:04:35.374
-He's stuck
at that point right there.

00:04:35.374 --> 00:04:38.043
That's a tricky...

00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:39.812
He did -- [ Laughs ]

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.748
This is what he did last time.

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:44.917
Yeah, he goes to that spot and
he just kind of camps out there.

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:46.718
[ Laughs ]
-Yeah. I don't know.

00:04:46.718 --> 00:04:49.655
-No, it's fine. I think
that he's comfortable there.

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:52.391
Let's give it up for Tuck,
'cause he did --

00:04:52.391 --> 00:04:53.493
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:56.128
I think you did a good job.

00:04:56.128 --> 00:04:58.997
Let's meet our last pet here.

00:04:58.997 --> 00:05:01.934
Uh, hey. What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:05.505
-Hi, my name's Lucy, and
I'm from Grantham in England.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:08.841
-Hey! We love it! Ah!
Thank you for watching us.

00:05:08.841 --> 00:05:13.546
Now, Lucy,
this is a great night for you,

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:17.549
because the other pets
haven't really shown

00:05:17.549 --> 00:05:19.786
and proven to us
why they're better than me.

00:05:19.786 --> 00:05:21.453
They are very cute.
-[ Indistinct ]

00:05:21.453 --> 00:05:23.456
-Yeah, so the pressure's on.
Who is there with you?

00:05:23.456 --> 00:05:26.092
Who do you have there?
-This is Trip Hazard.

00:05:26.092 --> 00:05:28.194
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:30.029
-Trip Hazard.
-Trip for short.

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:31.897
-[ Laughs ] Trip Hazard.

00:05:31.897 --> 00:05:35.401
What does Trip Hazard do?

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:38.137
-He closes the door,
but he's too small to do it,

00:05:38.137 --> 00:05:40.473
so he's got his own unique way
of doing it.

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:43.075
-Okay. Here we go.
This is Trip Hazard.

00:05:43.075 --> 00:05:44.543
Can we get a drum roll maybe
for Trip Hazard?

00:05:44.543 --> 00:05:46.078
He's gonna close the door.

00:05:46.078 --> 00:05:48.413
Trip Hazard. Trip Hazard.
-Close the door.

00:05:48.413 --> 00:05:50.983
Shut the door.
-This is -- This has potential!

00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:53.819
This has potential!
This is -- Yes!

00:05:53.819 --> 00:05:55.688
That's my -- That's a good dog!

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.390
Yes! Yes!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:01.460
Great job! Lucy, thank you!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.763
Great job, Trip Hazard.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:04.763 --> 00:06:07.667
Thank you to
all of our talented pets.

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:08.768
If you think you have a pet

00:06:08.768 --> 00:06:10.303
that's better than me,
I want to see it.

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:13.939
Go to tonightshow.com/
whyisyourpetbetterthanme

00:06:13.939 --> 00:06:14.874
to submit a video of your pet.

